<title>ARGENTINA: Panama's president on official visit to Argentina.</title>
<headline>Panama's president on official visit to Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panamanian President Ernesto Perez Balladares arrived in Argentina on Monday to begin an official visit.</p>
<p>Perez will meet Argentina's President Carlos Menem on Tuesday and sign bilateral agreements, Argentina's state-controlled Telam news agency reported.</p>
<p>He will leave Argentina on Friday for Paraguay.</p>
</text>
